---
import { GITHUB_URL } from '../data/work';
---

<section class="work wrap section field" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-title">
  <h2 id="work-title" class="section-title" data-reveal>Selected work</h2>

  <article class="row" aria-labelledby="cider-title">
    <figure class="row__picture">
      <img
        src="/work/cider-1-playlist.webp"
        width="1336"
        height="768"
        loading="lazy"
        alt="Cider 1 playing an Apple Music playlist, with the track list, playback bar and sidebar library."
      />
    </figure>
    <div class="row__text">
      <h3 id="cider-title" data-reveal style="--i: 1">Cider</h3>
      <p class="row__meta" data-reveal style="--i: 2">Apple Music for Windows, macOS and Linux. 2021–2022</p>
      <p class="row__fact" data-reveal style="--i: 3">Main process, plugin system and every release</p>
      <p data-reveal style="--i: 4">
        I started with the configuration system in Apple-Music-Electron, rewrote Cider's main process in TypeScript with
        a plugin system, and owned releases: CircleCI, Flatpak and the AUR packages.
      </p>
      <p class="row__links" data-reveal style="--i: 5">
        <a class="link" href="https://github.com/ciderapp/Cider">Source on GitHub</a>
        <a class="link" href="/blog/four-years-of-cider">The full story</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="row row--flip" aria-labelledby="cider2-title">
    <figure class="row__picture">
      <img
        src="/work/cider-2-settings.webp"
        width="840"
        height="509"
        loading="lazy"
        alt="Cider 2.3's settings over the library: the Visual page with General, Sweetener, Animated Artwork, Lyrics and Fonts."
      />
    </figure>
    <div class="row__text">
      <h3 id="cider2-title" data-reveal style="--i: 1">Cider 2</h3>
      <p class="row__meta" data-reveal style="--i: 2">The rewrite, with a team of fourteen. 2022–2025</p>
      <p class="row__fact" data-reveal style="--i: 3">One of three core leads; 20,000+ users</p>
      <p data-reveal style="--i: 4">
        I rebuilt the macOS and Linux client around a typed module system that plugs into Izanami, our shared Node
        core, and ran the build and release pipeline on self-hosted runners for every platform.
      </p>
      <p class="row__links" data-reveal style="--i: 5">
        <a class="link" href="https://github.com/ciderapp/Cider-2">Cider 2 on GitHub</a>
        <a class="link" href="/projects/cider">Write-up</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="row" aria-labelledby="nixos-title">
    <figure class="row__picture">
      <img
        src="/work/nixos-atlas.webp"
        width="1920"
        height="1080"
        loading="lazy"
        alt="The atlas desktop on Hyprland: flake.nix open in Neovim, fastfetch showing NixOS 26.05, and the flake's recent git history."
      />
    </figure>
    <div class="row__text">
      <h3 id="nixos-title" data-reveal style="--i: 1">nixos</h3>
      <p class="row__meta" data-reveal style="--i: 2">One flake for a NixOS desktop and a MacBook. 2024–now</p>
      <p class="row__fact" data-reveal style="--i: 3">Reproducible: a fresh machine is one command away</p>
      <p data-reveal style="--i: 4">
        Disko installs onto LUKS and btrfs, Secure Boot through Lanzaboote, and nix-darwin with Homebrew on the laptop,
        all from one repository.
      </p>
      <p class="row__links" data-reveal style="--i: 5">
        <a class="link" href={`${GITHUB_URL}/nixos`}>Source on GitHub</a>
        <a class="link" href="/projects/nixos-configuration">Write-up</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</section>

<style>
  .work {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2.5rem;
  }

  .row + .row {
    margin-top: clamp(1rem, 4.5vw, 3.5rem);
  }

  .row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr));
    column-gap: var(--gutter);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .row__picture {
    grid-column: 1 / span 7;
    margin: 0;
    overflow: clip;
  }

  .row__text {
    grid-column: 9 / -1;
  }

  .row--flip .row__picture {
    grid-column: 6 / -1;
    grid-row: 1;
  }

  .row--flip .row__text {
    grid-column: 1 / span 4;
    grid-row: 1;
  }

  .row__picture img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: 0 0;
  }

  .row__text h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-size: var(--step-lead);
  }

  .row__text p {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .row__meta {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .row__fact {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .row__links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.25rem !important;
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .row__picture {
      grid-column: 1 / span 6;
    }

    .row__text {
      grid-column: 7 / -1;
    }

    .row--flip .row__picture {
      grid-column: 7 / -1;
    }

    .row--flip .row__text {
      grid-column: 1 / span 6;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .row {
      row-gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .row__picture,
    .row__text,
    .row--flip .row__picture,
    .row--flip .row__text {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      grid-row: auto;
    }
  }
</style>
